8e8b7a29-db0e-11ef-8033-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臣瓚曰：壽二十四。安陵在長安北三十里。師古曰：去長陵一十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"臣瓒曰：寿二十四。安陵在长安北三十里。师古曰：去长陵一十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a24-db0e-11ef-9239-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"未央宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"未央宫","place_note":"时年二十三","resolved_place_entity_id":782,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2a-db0e-11ef-b2ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"安陵","place_note":"陝西咸陽東北三十里","resolved_place_entity_id":2109,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2b-db0e-11ef-9bf5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4秋，八月，戊寅，帝崩于未央宮。大赦天下。九月，辛丑，葬安陵。","content_fanyi":"秋季，八月戊寅日，汉惠帝刘盈在未央宫驾崩。大赦天下。九月辛丑日，将惠帝安葬于安陵。","content_jianti_auto":"4秋，八月，戊寅，帝崩于未央宫。大赦天下。九月，辛丑，葬安陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":987,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a23-db0e-11ef-9d60-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2e-db0e-11ef-b278-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：天子之言，一曰制書，二曰詔書。制書者，謂制度之命也，非皇后所得稱。今太后臨朝，行天子事，故稱制。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：天子之言，一曰制书，二曰诏书。制书者，谓制度之命也，非皇后所得称。今太后临朝，行天子事，故称制。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2d-db0e-11ef-b053-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-241,"link_death_year":-180,"link_td_description":"吕雉，字娥姁，一说名雉，汉高祖刘邦皇后，山东单父（今单县）人，为中国历史上首位有正式记载姓名的皇后与皇太后。","link_td_id":"Q10000140","link_td_number_id":95981,"people_name":"呂太后","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕太后","people_xingming":"吕雉","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2f-db0e-11ef-af4f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[吕雉]"},{"link_death_year":-163,"link_td_description":"张皇后，中国西汉时期皇族女性，为汉惠帝皇后。","link_td_id":"Q10001945","link_td_number_id":149888,"people_name":"張皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"张皇后","people_xingming":"张嫣","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a30-db0e-11ef-9467-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[张嫣]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"初，呂太后命張皇后取他人子養之，而殺其母，以爲太子。旣葬，太子卽皇帝位，年幼；太后臨朝稱制。","content_fanyi":"当初，吕太后让张皇后抱来别人的孩子抚养，又杀掉孩子的生母，立他做太子。安葬了惠帝之后，太子即皇帝位，年纪幼小；太后临朝称制，代行天子权力。","content_jianti_auto":"初，吕太后命张皇后取他人子养之，而杀其母，以为太子。既葬，太子即皇帝位，年幼；太后临朝称制。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":988,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a2c-db0e-11ef-96c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"七年","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8e8b7a1b-db0e-11ef-bf41-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（癸丑、前一八八）","year_int":-188},"message":"success","success":true}